      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tiogahistory.org/Site/Nichols.html",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Susquehanna River marks Nichols’ northern boundary, while the Pennsylvania state line borders its southern edge.",
